 "beatLines": [
  {
   "day": 18,
   "tag": "slot60",
   "text": "◈ THE TRIAL — the audience is restless. The System offers Debbie a trial, broadcast live. Survive it and take the slot. Refuse it and... well. The audience remembers refusals. (Ability slots: 5)"
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "tag": "sentiment-lesson",
   "text": "◈ RESONANCE HARMONICS — SYSTEM: \"HYPOTHESIS CONFIRMED. Objects with high observer-attention waveforms function as auxiliary capacitors. We call this RESONANCE HARMONICS. We do not know why the waveforms taste like grief. We have stopped asking.\" — Hold a keepsake. Think about them. The System will do the math. (It is not math. It is love. The System will never know.) Channel keepsakes from your pack."
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "tag": "demo",
   "text": "SYSTEM: \"DEMONSTRATION. Give me that — Trail compass. WATCH.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "tag": "channel",
   "text": "💛 You hold Trail compass. Breathe. The shaking eases. (−6 trauma)"
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "tag": "channel",
   "text": "💛 You hold Trail compass. Breathe. The shaking eases. (−6 trauma)"
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "tag": "channel",
   "text": "💛 You hold Reading Glasses. Breathe. The shaking eases. (−6 trauma)"
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "tag": "channel",
   "text": "💛 You hold Trail compass and practice — one gift, deeply. They would want you to get better at this. (+6 experience to Green Thumb)"
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "tag": "channel",
   "text": "💛 You hold Trail compass and practice — one gift, deeply. They would want you to get better at this. (+6 experience to Gossip Network)"
  },
  {
   "day": 22,
   "tag": "channel",
   "text": "💛 You hold Trail compass. Your gifts are not mastered — but they are lived-in, worn smooth by use, and they are with you. The feast was the weapon. (The next feast grants FEASTED until tomorrow's dawn: strikes & abilities uplifted, devotion ×1.5 — richer feasts hit harder.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 22,
   "tag": "feast",
   "text": "🍖 FEAST 📺 — Debbie opens the pantry wide: 4× Foraged food, 2× Garden harvest (dried), 1× Fish catch. Rowan, Fumiko, Sofia eat until the fire burns low. Somebody laughs so hard they cry. For one evening, nobody is surviving — they're just together. (−1,800 kcal from the pantry) The channeled keepsake feeds the feast — the feast was the weapon, and the surge rides the fire until tomorrow's dawn, spent only when the blades are warmed. (FEAST SURGE ×1.5 armed)"
  },
  {
   "day": 22,
   "tag": "feast",
   "text": "🍖 FEASTED ×2.03 until tomorrow's dawn (6 parts left): a proper feast. A channeled keepsake feeds the flames (devotion ×1.5). Strikes and abilities hit with the feast behind them."
  },
  {
   "day": 22,
   "tag": "draw",
   "text": "🌙 The cookfire's smell carried further than the laughter did — smoke and grease on the night wind. The Paparazzo is circling the edge of the light. It followed the feast here. (A scavenger, drawn by the feast. Face it while the feast is in you — or let the watch drive it off.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 22,
   "tag": "draw-call",
   "text": "[faceFeastDraw called: []] -> ok=true"
  },
  {
